    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fantasy customs officer simulator. Decide the fate of the heroes who want to get into the kingdom, on whose guard you stand. Check their backpacks for forbidden artifacts, stolen items, and contraband. And their characteristics to ensure they meet the needs and policies of the kingdom.\u00a0Be watchful, for the glory of the crown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New day - new rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start each workday by learning the new rules of the pass for the day. They change depending on the needs and policies of the kingdom. And are sure to increase in number and complexity as you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012870/extras/1dc397fd89cc7a4060cc8a4943208683.poster.avif?t=1744626242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012870/extras/1dc397fd89cc7a4060cc8a4943208683.webm?t=1744626242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012870/extras/1dc397fd89cc7a4060cc8a4943208683.mp4?t=1744626242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inspect travelers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine the contents of heroes' backpacks to discover forbidden artifacts, contraband, and stolen items. Also check their race, class, and level to see if they meet the requirements of the pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012870/extras/84f64ae0de3699d1e6086dc7cb8fe3e3.poster.avif?t=1744626242\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012870/extras/84f64ae0de3699d1e6086dc7cb8fe3e3.webm?t=1744626242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1012870/extras/84f64ae0de3699d1e6086dc7cb8fe3e3.mp4?t=1744626242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do your job responsibly!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detect and correctly mark all infractions to maximize your reward for doing your job responsibly. Make no mistake or you will be penalized!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Improve your workplace</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your earnings on improving your office and buying new tools to help you perform routine work tasks faster and easier.</p>",
